n a cinematic force with  leading roles in movies like 42 and get  on up compelling villainy no Ryan  Coogler film would be complete without  the director's muse Michael B Jordan the  actor starred in both of cooler's prior  pictures and this time he's getting to  do something totally new Jordan stars in  Black Panther as Eric hill monger an  exiled wakandan turned us black ops  soldier who returns to challenge two  chawla or the throne as with his last  two Kugler collaborations Jordan's work  in the film is already being hailed as  the  MC you villain since Loki considering  how much travel Marvel movies have had  making satisfying screen baddies lately  that's high praise for the red-hot  actors work in the movie scene stealers  with all the a-listers starring in Black  Panther it might be hard to believe that  an up-and-comer has emerged as the scene  stealer of the whole film but that's  exactly what happened with Leticia  Wright as Sheree  you might recognize right as Rini in  humans or nish in black mirrors black  Museum episode but after Black Panther  she's bound to be as big of a star as  anyone else on the film's roster the  character is brilliant sprightly and a  complete standout that'll definitely  make audiences smile and Sheree isn't  the only one with some major girl power  in Black Panther the characters of koay  and Nakia played by denis Guria and  Lupita Nyong'o respectively have also  received high marks for badassery mood  music  if the filmmaking and acting talent  involved in the film wasn't impressive  enough the film's soundtrack is also  brimming with exciting voices Kendrick  Lamar produced the album and managed to  round up hip-hop favorites like  schoolboy q Vince staples future The  Weeknd and scissor to contribute tracks  alongside Lamar himself Marvel's  guardians of the galaxy soundtracks  might have made waves for reviving some  old favorites but black panther is  taking things a step further with an  original album that's already 